
                       geant4-11-03-ref-09
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Split G4processes library into two G4processes_hadronic for the hadronic
   part and G4processes_core for the remainder. Supporting creation of
   categories that are just an interface to other categories.
 o In G4Box, optimised normal calculation in DistanceToOut().
 o Code revision in QSS field stepper and made QSS3 a choice in G4ChordFinder
   and G4QSSMessenger.
 o Added new class G4ExtendedPhysicsVector, a new data structure, which
   includes partial cross-sections and methods for random selection of a
   partial cross-section channel.
 o Code refactoring and optimisations in G4OpBoundaryProcess.
 

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


