processes/electromagnetic
-------------------------
- dna (emdna-V11-03-17)
  o Fixed the state update in AlongStepDoIt() of G4ChemReboundTransportation
    to avoid setting incorrect molecule positions (leading tracks) when the
    scavenger process is called.
  o Fixed the IRT_syn model (Stepper) to ensure it does not use minTimeStep
    (default = 1 ps) when DNA reactions do not yet share the same minTimeStep
    (used to optimize the chemistry).
  o Fixed the missed Equilibrium process in G4DNAMakeReaction for
    particle-based models (SBS, IRT_syn).
  o Deleted exception of no reactant (or reactions for the defined molecules)
    that should return nullptr for no reaction data.
  o Enabled atomic de-excitation in stationary regime for Rudd and Born models.
- standard (emstand-V11-03-11)
