    in this respect.
  o G4DeexPrecoParameters: defined limits maxZ=9, maxA=17 instead of maxZ=3
    maxA=5. Fermi BreakUp models will be used for light fragment de-excitation,
    which happens in high energy ion collision with light targets.
  o G4StatMF, G4StatMFMicroCanonical, G4Evaporation: fixed reported Coverity
    defects.
